###

### 3a. Reservar turno NO ABONADO - exitoso
POST http://localhost:8080/reservar_turno
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_turno": 1,
  "id_tarjeta": 1
}

###

### 3b. Reservar turno NO ABONADO - ya inscripto (repetir mismo request)
POST http://localhost:8080/reservar_turno
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_turno": 1,
  "id_tarjeta": 1
}

###

### 3c. Reservar turno NO ABONADO - tarjeta inválida
POST http://localhost:8080/reservar_turno
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_turno": 2,
  "id_tarjeta": 9999
}

